--- !u!114 &191001671
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 191001669}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a41ba8049b779ac4fb8d4e0a125ca140, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Project8.UI.LocalizedText
  english: 'HOW TO FLY

    - START / CONTINUE / RESTART live on the mission dock (left rail); the lower-left dock always pauses and plays.

    - CONTROLS drawer - WAVE LAB tab: shape the wave (amplitude, frequency, exaggeration), save it into four slots, replay it at the point you are observing.

    - ET tab: select station D1/D2/D3, toggle its optical detail and read the LF/HF channel readout.

    - Desktop Enter advances the story; VR input is unchanged.


    WHAT IS REAL / WHAT IS SIMPLIFIED

    - Waves are emitted at merger and travel outward causally at a chosen visualization speed - the causality is real, the speed is not (real gravitational waves move at light speed).

    - A real binary radiates through inspiral too; this demo only shows the post-merger wave for teaching.

    - Strain shown here is ~0.5; real detector strain is ~1e-21. The laser markers are slowed enormously.

    - Michelson principle is real: split -> different arm lengths -> recombine at the splitter -> dark-port intensity.

    - The ET triangle (3 stations, 60-degree arms, a nested LF/HF pair per station) shows the 2020 concept baseline - not final site geometry; drawn at 12 m where the real arms are ~10 km. LF/HF share one qualitative strain - no separate noise curves.

    - NOT simulated: Fabry-Perot build-up, recycling mirrors, suspensions or any noise sources.

    - The spacetime ''sheet'' is a 2D embedding analogy - not a material surface and not a solution of Einstein''s equations.

    - Riding the wave is a viewpoint, not a relativistic frame.'
  chinese: "\u5982\u4F55\u64CD\u4F5C\n- \u5F00\u59CB/\u7EE7\u7EED/\u91CD\u65B0\u5F00\u59CB\u4EFB\u52A1\u5728\u5DE6\u4FA7\u4EFB\u52A1\u575E\u4E0A\uFF1B\u5DE6\u4E0B\u89D2\u5E38\u9A7B\u575E\u968F\u65F6\u64AD\u653E/\u6682\u505C\u3002\n- \u300C\u63A7\u5236\u53F0\u300D\u62BD\u5C49\u2014\u2014\u6CE2\u5F62\u5B9E\u9A8C\u9875\uFF1A\u8C03\u8282\u6CE2\u5F62\uFF08\u632F\u5E45\u3001\u9891\u7387\u3001\u5938\u5F20\u5EA6\uFF09\uFF0C\u5B58\u5165\u56DB\u4E2A\u69FD\u4F4D\uFF0C\u5728\u5F53\u524D\u89C2\u5BDF\u70B9\u56DE\u653E\u3002\n- ET \u9875\uFF1A\u9009\u62E9\u6D4B\u7AD9 D1/D2/D3\uFF0C\u5F00\u5173\u5176\u5149\u8DEF\u7EC6\u8282\uFF0C\u67E5\u770B LF/HF \u901A\u9053\u8BFB\u6570\u3002\n- \u684C\u9762\u7AEF\u56DE\u8F66\u952E\u63A8\u8FDB\u5267\u60C5\uFF1BVR \u8F93\u5165\u4E0D\u53D8\u3002\n\n\u54EA\u4E9B\u662F\u771F\u5B9E\u7684\uFF0C\u54EA\u4E9B\u662F\u7B80\u5316\u7684\n- \u6CE2\u5728\u5E76\u5408\u65F6\u523B\u4EA7\u751F\u5E76\u56E0\u679C\u5730\u5411\u5916\u4F20\u64AD\u2014\u2014\u56E0\u679C\u6027\u662F\u771F\u7684\uFF0C\u901F\u5EA6\u4E0D\u662F\uFF08\u771F\u5B9E\u5F15\u529B\u6CE2\u4EE5\u5149\u901F\u4F20\u64AD\uFF09\u3002\n- \u771F\u5B9E\u53CC\u661F\u5728\u65CB\u8FD1\u9636\u6BB5\u540C\u6837\u8F90\u5C04\u5F15\u529B\u6CE2\uFF1B\u672C\u6F14\u793A\u4E3A\u6559\u5B66\u53EA\u5C55\u793A\u5E76\u5408\u540E\u7684\u6CE2\u5F62\u3002\n- \u6B64\u5904\u5E94\u53D8\u7EA6 0.5\uFF1B\u771F\u5B9E\u63A2\u6D4B\u5668\u5E94\u53D8\u7EA6 1e-21\u3002\u5149\u6807\u8BB0\u88AB\u5927\u5E45\u653E\u6162\u3002\n- \u8FC8\u514B\u8033\u5B59\u539F\u7406\u662F\u771F\u7684\uFF1A\u5206\u675F \u2192 \u4E0D\u540C\u81C2\u957F \u2192 \u5728\u5206\u675F\u5668\u91CD\u65B0\u6C47\u5408 \u2192 \u6697\u7AEF\u53E3\u5F3A\u5EA6\u3002\n- ET \u4E09\u89D2\u5F62\uFF083 \u4E2A\u6D4B\u7AD9\u300160 \u5EA6\u81C2\u3001\u6BCF\u7AD9\u4E00\u5BF9\u5D4C\u5957 LF/HF\uFF09\u5C55\u793A\u7684\u662F 2020 \u6982\u5FF5\u57FA\u7EBF\u2014\u2014\u5E76\u975E\u6700\u7EC8\u53F0\u5740\u51E0\u4F55\uFF1B\u56FE\u4E2D\u81C2\u957F 12 m\uFF0C\u771F\u5B9E\u7EA6 10 km\u3002LF/HF \u5171\u7528\u540C\u4E00\u6761\u5B9A\u6027\u5E94\u53D8\u2014\u2014\u6CA1\u6709\u72EC\u7ACB\u7684\u566A\u58F0\u66F2\u7EBF\u3002\n- \u672A\u6A21\u62DF\uFF1A\u6CD5\u5E03\u91CC-\u73C0\u7F57\u589E\u76CA\u3001\u5FAA\u73AF\u955C\u3001\u60AC\u6302\u7CFB\u7EDF\u4E0E\u4EFB\u4F55\u566A\u58F0\u6E90\u3002\n- \u65F6\u7A7A\u201C\u8584\u819C\u201D\u662F\u4E8C\u7EF4\u5D4C\u5165\u7C7B\u6BD4\u2014\u2014\u4E0D\u662F\u5B9E\u4F53\u8868\u9762\uFF0C\u4E5F\u4E0D\u662F\u7231\u56E0\u65AF\u5766\u65B9\u7A0B\u7684\u89E3\u3002\n- \u201C\u4E58\u6CE2\u800C\u884C\u201D\u53EA\u662F\u89C2\u5BDF\u89C6\u89D2\uFF0C\u4E0D\u662F\u76F8\u5BF9\u8BBA\u53C2\u8003\u7CFB\u3002"
  dutch: 'HOE TE VLIEGEN

    - START / DOORGAAN / HERSTARTEN staan op het missiedok (linker rail); het linkerdok onder pauzeert en speelt altijd.

    - CONTROLS-lade - tabblad WAVE LAB: vorm de golf (amplitude, frequentie, overdrijving), sla hem op in vier slots en speel hem af op het punt dat je bekijkt.

    - ET-tab: kies station D1/D2/D3, schakel het optische detail om en lees de LF/HF-kanalen.

    - Enter op desktop schakelt het verhaal verder; VR-invoer is ongewijzigd.


    WAT IS ECHT / WAT IS VEREENVOUDIGD

    - Golven ontstaan bij de samensmelting en planten zich causaal voort met een gekozen visualisatiesnelheid - de causaliteit is echt, de snelheid niet (echte zwaartekrachtgolven gaan met lichtsnelheid).

    - Een echte dubbelster straalt ook tijdens de inspiraalfase; deze demo toont alleen de golf na de samensmelting.

    - Getoonde rek is ~0.5; echte detectorrek is ~1e-21. De lichtmarkeringen zijn enorm vertraagd.

    - Het Michelson-principe is echt: splitsen -> verschillende armlengtes -> hercombineren bij de splitter -> donkere poort.

    - De ET-driehoek (3 stations, 60-graden armen, een genest LF/HF-paar per station) toont de concept-basislijn van 2020 - geen definitieve locatiegeometrie; hier 12 m, de echte armen zijn ~10 km. LF/HF delen een kwalitatieve rek - geen aparte ruiscurves.

    - NIET gesimuleerd: Fabry-Perot-opbouw, recycling-spiegels, ophangingen of ruisbronnen.

    - Het ruimtetijd-''vel'' is een 2D-embeddinganalogie - geen materieel oppervlak en geen oplossing van Einsteins vergelijkingen.

    - Op de golf surfen is een gezichtspunt, geen relativistisch stelsel.'
--- !u!114 &191001672
